here?<br>There's nothing to be afraid of friend;<br>why, I've gone up there a few times as well.<br><br>a\u0337nd I'm perfectly fine<br><br>Doesn't matter if you think so or not,<br>we both know you'll go up there.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">So be sure to knock when you go on in.</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1771780/extras/70d9c7b2a95f4c9d23a2994fdd70dd2c.poster.avif?t=1689733480\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1771780/extras/70d9c7b2a95f4c9d23a2994fdd70dd2c.webm?t=1689733480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1771780/extras/70d9c7b2a95f4c9d23a2994fdd70dd2c.mp4?t=1689733480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><br>Oh, I do hope your wit is as big as your curiosity.<br>That estate is a tricky thing to explore.<br>Keys and Puzzles, Notes and Riddles<br>Its residents are quite a secretive bunch.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">I'm sure there's a lot to uncover</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1771780/extras/2ddfbae1377bdab16e3bfb6bb0975d0c.poster.avif?t=1689733480\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1771780/extras/2ddfbae1377bdab16e3bfb6bb0975d0c.webm?t=1689733480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1771780/extras/2ddfbae1377bdab16e3bfb6bb0975d0c.mp4?t=1689733480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><br>Oh yes the residents, don't mind them.<br>They're a little shy at first, but they'll warm up to you.<br>So don't let their callousness offend you,<br>I assure you they'd love to pick your brain.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">&quot;I'm sure they'll love you&quot;</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1771780/extras/4f06a89a317695d19bd22db9ed007d2b.poster.avif?t=1689733480\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1771780/extras/4f06a89a317695d19bd22db9ed007d2b.webm?t=1689733480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1771780/extras/4f06a89a317695d19bd22db9ed007d2b.mp4?t=1689733480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><br>Well friend, that's all from me.<br>Stay safe up there,<br>and don't get too overwhelmed<br>I hope you enjoy your stay,<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>and welcome to ClayTown</strong></h2>",
